<% content_for :title, "Welcome — Jozu" %>
<div class="space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Your Japanese learning profile</h1>
  <p>Create a profile to keep your progress and preferences across devices. No email or password needed.</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">You’ll get a private link to bookmark. Anyone with that link can access and change your progress. If you lose the link and sign out, we can’t recover your profile automatically.</p>
  <%= button_to "Create my learning profile", account_path, class: "w-full rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white", data: { turbo: false } %>
  <p class="text-sm">Already have a profile? Open your saved access link to return to it, including on another device.</p>
</div>
